{ Tests for PascalApi.Crypto (SHA-256, HMAC-SHA256, Base64url) and
  PascalApi.Jwt (HS256 sign/verify, alg check, exp/nbf).

  Vectors: SHA-256 from FIPS 180-4's examples plus lengths around the
  64-byte block (computed with Python's hashlib); HMAC from RFC 4231 test
  cases 1, 2, 3, 6 and 7; Base64url from RFC 4648 section 10; the HS256
  token is jwt.io's well-known example, recomputed with Python's hmac.
  Time for exp/nbf comes from a fixed clock installed in TClock.

  DUnitX master. The FPCUnit mirror (tests/Unit/fpc) is generated by
  tools/gen_fpc_mirror.py; never edit the mirror by hand. }

